  "job_C7.6_20251003_115523": {
    "chunk_text": "draco iste quem formasti ad illudendum ei \u00fe\u00e6r fara\u00fe draca \u00fees \u00feone \u00feu omnia a te expectant ut des illis escam in tempore ealle fram \u00fee bidia\u00f0 on tide. Dante te illis colligent; aperiente te manum tuam omnia implebuntur bonitate sillend to \u00fee him hy Auertente autem te faciem turbabuntur; auferes spiritum eorum et deficient, et in puluerem suum Emittes spiritum tuum et creabuntur; et renouabis faciem terre asend gast \u00feinne & beo\u00f0 gesceapene Sit gloria domini in seculum; letabitur dominus in operibus suis sy wuldur on worulda beo\u00f0 on Qui respicit terram et facit eam tremere; qui tangit montes et fumigant se geloca\u00f0 eor\u00f0an & de\u00f0 hi Cantabo domino in uita mea; psallam deo meo quamdiu sum ic singe on lif min ic singe minum Iocundum sit ei eloquium meum; ego uero delectabor in domino wynsum si him ic so\u00felice \u00feu Deficiant peccatores a terra, et iniqui ita ut non sint; benedic anima mea domino geteorien synfulle confitemini domino et inuocate nomen eius; annuntiate inter gentes opera eius andetta\u00fe & ciga\u00fe cantate ei et psallite ei; narrate omnia mirabilia eius singa\u00fe him & sealm him cy\u00fea\u00fe ealle wundru laudamini in nomine sancto eius.",
